cts how you learn information during re...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID2","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_dcdYhRXVG6jPrDL","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID204","SecondaryAttribute":"The key to the design called experimental is assignment of subjects to conditions randomly. ","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"The key to the design called experimental is assignment of subjects to conditions randomly.&nbsp;","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q204","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"The key to the design called experimental is assignment of subjects to conditions randomly. ","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID204"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_dcdYhRXVG6jPrDL","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID16","SecondaryAttribute":"The manuscript was a sonnet sequence that she had written about their courtship and their love le...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"The manuscript was a sonnet sequence that she had written about their courtship and their love letters.","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q16","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"The manuscript was a sonnet sequence that she had written about their courtship and their love le...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID16"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_dcdYhRXVG6jPrDL","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID87","SecondaryAttribute":"The nucleus of an atom is held together by a kind of energy called atomic energy.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"The nucleus of an